pbwinput 1
# The Pokemon Center save, made on the oracle from the starter save (oracle.py save center_save; README.md, "Saves"):
# CONTINUE at the Aspertia City lookout and Hugh's battle as hugh_w2_us.pbwinput plays them, A every 16 frames through
# the battle (Tepig grows to level 6) and Hugh's first words, then B through the rest of the scene and the Pokemon
# Center's (healing, the PC, the Mart, 10 Poke Balls), then the field menu's SAVE once the player is free there. The
# piece of phase 4's route after Hugh's battle (route19) starts from it, as the DS left it. The clock is pinned, as in
# the route's sequences, and the seed lines are the random seeds the DS builds here, hugh_w2_us.pbwinput's (oracle.py
# seeds center_save), so that the port plays Hugh's battle from them too. Counts are GFL's frame count (sVBlankCount).
# On game frames. White 2, with Black 2's presses.
version w2_us
clock pinned
seed 0x270fd5258c56ebe3  # GFL's, at start-up (oracle frame 20)
seed 0xd9e8a930f9403e3b  # Hugh's battle's (oracle frame 8714)
1100 START  # START in the opening skips it to the title (count 1115 on both)
1101 -
3000 START  # START brings back the layers the title hid at count 2877
3001 -
3100 START  # START leaves for the start menu, which shows from count 3249
3101 -
3400 A  # CONTINUE: the lookout (zone 427) at (36,710), facing Bianca, free from count 3742
3401 -
3800 DOWN  # down to (36,714): Hugh's arrival (Script_33 while 0x40a1 is 4), from count 3878
3880 -
3900 DOWN+B  # B through it (0x40a1 = 5 at count 5974), then down to (36,716): Hugh's challenge (Script_8), the battle from count 6350
